<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-10856] cassandra-store seems to be broken by incorrect guava version</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10856</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9131&quot; title=&quot;Upgrade guava version in Apache Ignite&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-9131&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-9131&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; upgrade guava from 18 to 25.&lt;br/&gt;
However, cassandra-driver-core:3.0 dependency of the Ignite&apos;s cassandra-store requires guava 16-19.&lt;br/&gt;
Need to fix the dependency conflict there.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13207455">IGNITE-10856</key>
            <summary>cassandra-store seems to be broken by incorrect guava version</summary>
                <type id="1" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&amp;avatarId=21133&amp;avatarType=issuetype">Bug</type>
                                            <priority id="1" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/priorities/blocker.svg">Blocker</priority>
                        <status id="5" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/statuses/resolved.png" description="A resolution has been taken, and it is awaiting verification by reporter. From here issues are either reopened, or are closed.">Resolved</status>
                    <statusCategory id="3" key="done" colorName="green"/>
                                    <resolution id="1">Fixed</resolution>
                                        <assignee username="samaitra">Saikat Maitra</assignee>
                                    <reporter username="slukyanov">Stanislav Lukyanov</reporter>
                        <labels>
                    </labels>
                <created>Thu, 3 Jan 2019 11:10:35 +0000</created>
                <updated>Fri, 11 Jan 2019 00:30:59 +0000</updated>
                            <resolved>Thu, 10 Jan 2019 12:19:13 +0000</resolved>
                                                    <fixVersion>2.8</fixVersion>
                                    <component>cassandra</component>
                        <due></due>
                            <votes>0</votes>
                                    <watches>5</watches>
                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="16732921" author="slukyanov" created="Thu, 3 Jan 2019 11:12:17 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;There is a fix for the cassandra-driver in 3.2 that added compatibility with guava 20+ - &lt;a href=&quot;https://datastax-oss.atlassian.net/browse/JAVA-1328&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://datastax-oss.atlassian.net/browse/JAVA-1328&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;
Given that, the best option seems to be to upgrade the cassandra-driver to a newer version.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16732924" author="slukyanov" created="Thu, 3 Jan 2019 11:13:43 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;This is something we really should fix ASAP (i.e. in the next version), so I&apos;m putting fixVersion=2.8 to have this on the radar.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16733049" author="dpavlov" created="Thu, 3 Jan 2019 13:49:40 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I&apos;ve set blocker priority. According to the user list there can be workaround, so it is not a reason to prepare emergency release, but I&apos;m sure it should be blocker&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16735360" author="samaitra" created="Sun, 6 Jan 2019 23:02:32 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Hi &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=dpavlov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;dpavlov&quot;&gt;dpavlov&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=slukyanov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;slukyanov&quot;&gt;slukyanov&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I have raised the following PR for the same&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/5780/&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/5780/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Please review and share feedback.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Regards&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Saikat&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16738404" author="ilyak" created="Wed, 9 Jan 2019 16:14:38 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;We seem to have further problems:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We are trying to start Cassandra Embedded, but only Cassandra 3.11.x is compatible with our version of Guava.&lt;br/&gt;
However, Cassandra driver 3.2.0 doesn&apos;t seem to be compatible with Cassandra (Embedded) 3.11.x.&lt;br/&gt;
Do we want to bump Cassandra driver version further?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16738405" author="ilyak" created="Wed, 9 Jan 2019 16:15:12 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=samaitra&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;samaitra&quot;&gt;samaitra&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=slukyanov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;slukyanov&quot;&gt;slukyanov&lt;/a&gt; please see above&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16739346" author="ilyak" created="Thu, 10 Jan 2019 12:19:01 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Looks like I didn&apos;t have to update driver further. I have created a separate ticket to add tests to suite. &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=samaitra&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;samaitra&quot;&gt;samaitra&lt;/a&gt; thank you for your contribution, I have merged your patch along with some test tweaks.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16739898" author="samaitra" created="Fri, 11 Jan 2019 00:30:59 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ilyak&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ilyak&quot;&gt;ilyak&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Thank you so much, much appreciate your help.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Regards,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Saikat&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
